version: "0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-10-22"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - ota
  - over-the-air-updates
  - uptane
  - software-defined-vehicle
  - automotive
  - testbed
  - reproducible-research
abstract: >-
  vxota is an OTA server with Uptane-flavored signing and a content-addressed artifact store, written
  in Rust. It is the measurable OTA workload behind the H4 co-location experiment of vxedge. It is not
  a production OTA stack.
